        "title": "Impact of bariatric surgery on hypertensive disorders in pregnancy: retrospective analysis of insurance claims data",
        "authors": [
          "Wendy L. Bennett",
          "Marta M. Gilson",
          "R. Jamshidi",
          "A. Burke",
          "J. Segal",
